# 8️⃣ File Permissions

Permission format:

```text
rwx rwx rwx
```

Represents:

* Owner
* Group
* Others

Values:

| Permission | Value |
| ---------- | ----: |
| Read       |     4 |
| Write      |     2 |
| Execute    |     1 |

Example:

```text
755
```

Owner = 7 (rwx)

Group = 5 (r-x)

Others = 5 (r-x)

